# held/props/book: an open book for the Read posture (PROPS, P2b): two pages of linen in a leather binding with a brass
# clasp hanging, held open in both hands before the chest (hold) and held out to read (reach). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# Between the pose arms' grips, anchored on the right shoulder; under the fists.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held book
anchor shoulderR
keys held
z 40

view D key hold origin -3 -3 layer neck
